      "device_type": "combinerbox",
      "operate_status": "training",
      "run_mode": "train"
    },
    "template_type": "pv_fault_diagnosis_quickval_cv",
    "note": "无泄漏重复分层评估版：相比 workflow-pv-fault-diag-quickval-v1，尾部改为 stratified_cv_eval 单算子，解决 SMOTE 在切分之前导致的数据泄漏问题。"
  },
